n style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids (Sub10 1K e Sub12\/14\/16 2K)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 12:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Trail Kids Curto Sub10 (1 km):<\/strong> 2,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Trail Kids Longo Sub12\/14\/16 (2 km):<\/strong> 4,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o V Trail Veredas de Nexe 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida, chegada e secretariado no edif\u00edcio da Junta de Freguesia de Santa B\u00e1rbara de Nexe (Estrada da Relva 8, Po\u00e7o de Mouro), no concelho de Faro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e tempos limite?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No domingo, 22 de novembro: Trail 35+ km (1200m D+, limite 7h) parte \u00e0s 08:00; Trail Sprint 18+ km (650m D+, limite 5h) \u00e0s 08:30; Mini Trail 10 km (300m D+, limite 3h) \u00e0s 09:00; Caminhada 6 km (60m D+, limite 2h) \u00e0s 09:30; e Trail Kids (1 km e 2 km) \u00e0s 12:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 3 fases (at\u00e9 17\/09, at\u00e9 31\/10 e de 01\/11 a 15\/11\/2026): Trail 35+ km (20 \u20ac \/ 25 \u20ac \/ 30 \u20ac, ou 17 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac \/ 27 \u20ac para filiados AAAlgarve), Trail Sprint 18+ km (15 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac \/ 25 \u20ac, ou 12 \u20ac \/ 17 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac para filiados), Mini Trail 10 km (10 \u20ac \/ 13 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac), Caminhada 6 km (6 \u20ac \/ 7 \u20ac \/ 9 \u20ac) e Trail Kids (2 \u20ac e 4 \u20ac). O almo\u00e7o opcional custa 7 \u20ac para atletas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido nas provas de trail?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nas tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias competitivas (Trail 35+ km, Trail Sprint 18+ km e Mini Trail 10 km) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio passar pelo Controlo Zero e transportar reservat\u00f3rio de l\u00edquidos de pelo menos 1 litro, copo reutiliz\u00e1vel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica e dorsal vis\u00edvel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e onde funcionam o secretariado e os banhos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o pertence \u00e0 Algarviana Team \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Desportiva, com homologa\u00e7\u00e3o da AAAlgarve. O secretariado funciona na Junta de Freguesia no s\u00e1bado (21\/11, das 14:00 \u00e0s 20:00) e no domingo (22\/11, das 06:30 \u00e0s 09:15). Os banhos t\u00eam lugar no Polidesportivo de Santa B\u00e1rbara de Nexe (Rua Jo\u00e3o Baleiz\u00e3o).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"V Trail Veredas de Nexe 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Junta de Freguesia de Santa B\u00e1rbara de Nexe (Estrada da Relva 8), Faro\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Faro\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Algarviana Team \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Desportiva\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o V Trail Veredas de Nexe 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida, chegada e secretariado no edif\u00edcio da Junta de Freguesia de Santa B\u00e1rbara de Nexe (Estrada da Relva 8, Po\u00e7o de Mouro), no concelho de Faro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e tempos limite?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No domingo, 22 de novembro: Trail 35+ km (1200m D+, limite 7h) parte \u00e0s 08:00; Trail Sprint 18+ km (650m D+, limite 5h) \u00e0s 08:30; Mini Trail 10 km (300m D+, limite 3h) \u00e0s 09:00; Caminhada 6 k